                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "There\u2019s no reason why patients in America should be paying more than patients in other similar nations for the same prescription drugs.\n\nI wrote the End Price Gouging for Medications Act to bring down Big Pharma\u2019s sky high prices and protect patients.",
