                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I spoke with health care providers in Central Oregon about how Trump's Big, Ugly Betrayal will gut health care for 200,000 Oregonians, damage rural clinics and hospitals, and cost Oregon nearly $15 BILLION over six years.\n\nThat\u2019s families lose, billionaires win. I'm fighting for a vision of families win, billionaires pay their fair share.",
